Genflow Biosciences PLC Announces Appointment of Investor Relations Adviser
LONDON, UK / ACCESS Newswire / September 7, 2026 / Genflow Biosciences Plc (LSE:GENF)(OTCQB:GENFF) (""Genflow"" or ""the Company""), an emerging leader in the field of longevity research, today announces the appointment of ON365 Partners Inc. (""ON365"") as the Company's investor relations adviser, with immediate effect. ON365 succeeds Harbor Access, which has supported the Company's investor relations activities to date.
