Press Release
OTC Disclosure & News Service | 09/07/2026
B Treasury Capital AB (""BTC AB"") intends to offer all holders of B shares voluntary redemption at a price below the company's net asset value per B share. Final terms and the exact timetable will be announced in a separate press release. Full information will be available at btc.se when the final terms are announced.
In brief
•        Voluntary offer to all B shareholders. Those who do not wish to participate need not take any action.
•        The company will redeem shares for a maximum of SEK 5 million, funded from existing cash. No Bitcoin will be sold.
