MAX Amphibious ATV Returns to The Price Is Right for Star Trek 60th Anniversary Special
Iconic American amphibious ATV brand returns to the legendary game show after 22 MAX vehicles were featured as prizes between 1985 and 2008
BRADENTON, Fla., Sept. 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Recreatives Industries, Inc. (OTC: RECX) (“Recreatives” or the “Company”), manufacturer of MAX six-wheel-drive amphibious all-terrain vehicles, today announced that its MAX 2 amphibious ATV will be featured on a special episode of CBS’s The Price Is Right celebrating the 60th anniversary of Star Trek.
The episode airs today, Tuesday, Sept. 8, from 11:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. ET / 10:00 to 11:00 a.m. PT on CBS, and will also be available to stream on Paramount+.
The appearance marks a return to familiar territory for the MAX brand. Between 1985 and 2008, 22 MAX vehicles were featured on The Price Is Right. Today’s appearance continues a relationship between MAX and one of America’s longest-running television programs that dates back more than four decades.
