Hybrid Power Solutions Establishes Larger Manufacturing Facility in Mississauga, Ontario to Support Increased Production
(via TheNewswire)
  Toronto, Ontario –TheNewswire -September 9, 2026 – Hybrid Power Solutions Inc. (CSE: HPSS) (OTC: HPSIF) (FSE: E092) (“Hybrid” or the “Company”), a Canadian manufacturer of portable and fuel-free power solutions, announces that it has established a larger manufacturing facility in Mississauga, Ontario.
The Mississauga facility is intended to support increased production capacity as the Company scales its fuel-free and hybrid portable power platforms. Production at the facility is planned to include dedicated lines for the Company’s Batt Pack product line and for Spark and Terra production, enabling Hybrid to better organize manufacturing by product family and respond to growing customer demand.
