Copper Giant Resources Corp. Begins Trading on OTCQX Best Market
NEW YORK, Sept. 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- OTC Markets Group Inc. (OTCQX: OTCM), operator of regulated markets for trading 12,000 U.S. and international securities, today announced Copper Giant Resources Corp. (TSX-V: CGNT; OTCQX: CGNRF), a mineral exploration company, has qualified to trade on the OTCQX® Best Market. Copper Giant Resources Corp. upgraded to OTCQX from the OTCQB® Venture Market.
