River Valley Community Bancorp and River Valley Community Bank Mourn the Passing of Founding Director Michael C. Wheeler
Yuba City community leader, longtime bank director, businessman, and friend remembered for his counsel, service, and lasting contributions
YUBA CITY, Calif., Sept. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- River Valley Community Bancorp (OTC Markets: RVCB), parent company of River Valley Community Bank (collectively referred to as the “Bank”), today announced with deep sadness the unexpected passing of founding and sitting director Michael C. “Mike” Wheeler, who passed away peacefully on August 29, 2026, surrounded by family. Mr. Wheeler was 76.
