BTC AB offers redemption of B shares for up to SEK 5 million at a 28 percent discount to net asset value
Press Release
OTC Disclosure & News Service | 09/11/2026
The board of B Treasury Capital AB (""BTC AB"") has resolved to offer all holders of B shares voluntary redemption at net asset value per B share less 28 percent. The application period is 18 to 24 September 2026. Full information and questions and answers will be available at btc.se/redemption before the application period opens.
In brief
•      Voluntary. Those who do not wish to participate need not take any action.
•      Open to all holders of B shares on the record date, 16 September 2026. Last day to buy with the right to participate is 14 September.
•      Price: net asset value per B share at 17.30 on 25 September 2026, less 28 percent. Approximately SEK 107 per share based on net asset value as of 10 September.
•      Cap: SEK 5 million, funded from existing cash. No Bitcoin will be sold.
