Bell Rose Capital Inc. (OTCID:BELR) Subsidiary 4biddenknowledge Inc. Outlines Expansion Initiatives for the 4biddenknowledge Podcast Network
Press Release
OTC Disclosure & News Service | 09/11/2026
Company describes its current multi-channel podcast and video operations and initiatives in video production, short-form distribution, guest programming, Spanish-language content, and sponsorship sales
LOS ANGELES, CA  Bell Rose Capital Inc. (OTCID: BELR) (""Bell Rose"" or the ""Company"") today announced that its wholly owned subsidiary, 4biddenknowledge Inc. (""4BK""), has commenced a set of initiatives to expand the production, distribution, and commercial operations of the 4biddenknowledge Podcast Network, the podcast and digital video operation built around the 4biddenknowledge Podcast hosted by 4BK founder, Billy Carson.
The 4biddenknowledge Podcast has been in production for over 5 years and has published dozens of episodes.  The program covers ancient history, science, personal development, and financial literacy and is distributed through 4BK TV and on YouTube.  As of September 1st, 2026 the network's YouTube channels had over 1.2M subscribers in total
